{"evt":"note_created","id":"note-mqd8r0dulaw","workspace":"/Users/imyu/Desktop/zonoid","title":"Corrected WARM held-out retrieval baseline (embed-warmup gate added; cold lexical baseline retired)","summary":"OVERRIDE: the prior locked baseline (note-mqd6hrlnbhp) was measured COLD — the held-out harness (scripts/retrieval-bench.js --heldout --isolated) fired queries before the MiniLM sidecar warmed in the isolated daemon process, so /search returned qvec=null and silently fell back to LEXICAL-only ranking. Confirmed by probing the isolated daemon: first ~3 /search calls come back via=lexical, then flip to via=semantic (different top1). FIX: added an embed-warmup GATE in retrieval-bench.js (warmupGate) that polls /search with a fixed probe and BLOCKS until every hit is via=semantic, with a 90s timeout and HARD-FAIL (exit 3) if never warm — never silently scores on a cold/lexical embedder again. Wired into both runDefaultEval and runHeldoutEval after the daemon /ping. CORRECTED WARM BASELINE (3 consecutive runs byte-identical AND warm-semantic; this is what Step 2+ measures against): task-transcript recall@5=1.0 MRR@5=1.0 recall@10=1.0 (was MRR 0.875 cold); locale-sum recall@5=1.0 MRR@5=1.0 recall@10=1.0; bench-metric recall@5=0.6 MRR@5=0.4667 recall@10=0.6 (was 0.4/0.3 cold — this is the real recall headroom); interval-merge negative-control 0 contamination. recall@10==recall@5 everywhere. CI test test/retrieval-quality.test.js is NOT subject to the race: it never calls embed() or hits a daemon — it scores offline via scoreNodeAgainstTokens+suggestToks (lexical token-overlap, deterministic-lexical-BY-DESIGN over a reconstructed corpus), so its 0.9464/0.8929 numbers are a stable lexical floor, not warm-semantic. Added focused test test/retrieval-warmup-gate.test.js. SCOPE: harness/measurement integrity only — no ranking-logic change. Full suite: 10 pre-existing failures (app-restart, filedrop-daemon, force-claim-cap, metric-branch-claim, newly-ready, phase2-integration, should-stop-advisory, sweep, touch-agent, unwired-quarantine) predate this work (git-stash confirmed); my two retrieval tests pass.","created_by":"main","valid_from":"2026-06-14T03:45:08.274Z","vec":[-0.052215687930583954,-0.047291193157434464,0.005174575839191675,0.07651203870773315,0.007355297915637493,-0.013538998551666737,-0.034108445048332214,0.016676710918545723,0.03765561804175377,0.0036554669495671988,-0.012892420403659344,-0.037694137543439865,0.0585145503282547,-0.030735699459910393,-0.023216653615236282,-0.026396827772259712,0.08317260444164276,0.025661272928118706,-0.0742393359541893,-0.0166533924639225,0.0558878518640995,0.008750387467443943,0.06666252762079239,-0.03655695915222168,-0.011936110444366932,-0.01880587637424469,-0.12178481370210648,0.004069197922945023,-0.026896504685282707,0.008739182725548744,-0.024993138387799263,0.059143148362636566,-0.0437798835337162,0.012346925213932991,0.004090290516614914,0.10674222558736801,-0.10430536419153214,-0.028093663975596428,-0.04598802700638771,-0.04902777448296547,-0.008865110576152802,0.004021509550511837,-0.03741322085261345,-0.00623907009139657,0.039326854050159454,-0.0029035485349595547,-0.12066332995891571,-0.026012495160102844,-0.07877172529697418,-0.061969906091690063,-0.05629861727356911,0.06703021377325058,-0.010511339642107487,0.07208989560604095,-0.007055577822029591,0.11783184111118317,0.05386294797062874,-0.0026306856889277697,-0.03210064768791199,-0.03595630079507828,-0.0713847428560257,-0.07307146489620209,-0.041209008544683456,-0.06273198872804642,0.04406560957431793,-0.04066258668899536,0.009216144680976868,-0.01811002381145954,0.10231920331716537,-0.015043474733829498,0.0024476165417581797,0.0360180027782917,0.03206866607069969,-0.04474834352731705,0.0028174694161862135,0.07432357221841812,0.0185835100710392,-0.050018880516290665,0.020561276003718376,-0.056881941854953766,-0.015982670709490776,-0.062373340129852295,-0.000498178880661726,-0.005668900907039642,0.01669025979936123,0.0018